  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-21T20:17:28.640Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the current state of the debug system, the debug overlay is hidden on instance join, and is not visible when loading. A nice thing about the old system is that you could see the live log while the instance was loading, specifically so you could see log messages in Start(), as well as not having to reopen it every time you rejoin an instance to test things, such as in build & test.\n\nIt would be good to have the debug overlay visible during world load, or failing that, have it remember its previous opened state when transitioning worlds (at least if local movement is enabled)",
